Q: Magento “Cannot add the item to shopping cart.” For no apparent reason A: <p>This solution worked for me
go to</p>
<pre><code>app/code/core/Mage/Checkout/controllers/CartController.php
</code></pre>
<p>and
find this code and comment it.
Your issue will be solved.</p>
<pre><code>public function addAction()
{
    if (!$this-&gt;_validateFormKey()) {
         $this-&gt;_goBack();
         return;
     }
</code></pre>
